{{Term/Store|Tingle's Shirt||Series, BotW, TotK}} is an [[Item]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
Tingle's Shirt can be found as part of the [[Side Quest]] "[[EX Treasure: Fairy Clothes]]" exclusive to {{TMT}} [[Downloadable Content]] Pack. It can be found inside a [[Hidden Chest]] buried in the ruins of the [[Castle Town Prison]], which can be lifted from the ground with [[Magnesis]]. After obtaining it, [[Granté]] will begin to sell Tingle's Shirt in [[Tarrey Town]]. It's part of [[Tingle's Outfit]] along with [[Tingle's Hood]] and [[Tingle's Tights]]. Tingle's Shirt offers no additional effects on its own or as part of a set. It cannot be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]], nor can it be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

